  surveyName: Simulator Sickness Questionnaire (SSQ)
  surveyDescription: "This survey examines various simulator-related sickness symptoms.
    Answer questions according to how you are feeling now.\n\nAim the ray from your
    controller at your desired response and pull the trigger to select it. After
    selecting a response, aim the ray at \u201CNEXT\u201D in the bottom-right corner
    of the menu and pull the trigger to continue to the next question."
  surveyEndStatement: Thank you for completing the Simulator Sickness Questionnaire.
